hey also have a large variety of flavors and add-ins. Will visit again!"},{"business_id":"lDS0quWgtTETLqYgMh-UtA","review_id":"MD4pi_YXErc7A3ENHiqXbQ","date":"2014-11-03T21:51:15","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8931352496147156,"text_excerpt":"Great little juice place!! While we were in NOLA, I got the pumpkin smoothie, the migraine killer (forget the exact name but something like that), and the Renewal juice. Everything was amazing. Little pricey because they are $8, but obviously a lot of fresh veggies and fruits go into each one. And the flavors are super unique and tasty."},{"business_id":"lDS0quWgtTETLqYgMh-UtA","review_id":"sl118OkjcrCP5brrvtpVbA","date":"2019-10-24T14:34:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.8857866525650024,"text_excerpt":"We were staying downtown while visiting the city, but made the trip over here several times just to grab a smoothie. The ingredient combinations are thoughtfully crafted and delicious without any modifications. We had to wait a while on one of our trips, because they were custom designing a special menu and making the items fresh for a customer who hadn't been feeling well. Worth the wait to witness that level of service and expertise."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"lDS0quWgtTETLqYgMh-UtA","photo_id":"hWLD9MCR0fh_3Yt8tFSorw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/hWLD9MCR0fh_3Yt8tFSorw.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0000001192092896}]},"notebook_case":null}
